  "description": "SignalFlux.Space provides space telemetry support for CCSDS Space Packets, CCSDS time codes (CUC/CDS), and ECSS Packet Utilization Standard (PUS) TM packetization with Service 3 housekeeping bridged to Measurement<T>.",
  "id": "SignalFlux.Space",
  "isPrerelease": false,
