  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- CCSDS Space Packet primary-header framing (decode and encode, TM focus)\n      - CCSDS time codes: CUC (unsegmented) and CDS (day-segmented) to SignalFlux.Timestamp\n      - ECSS PUS TM secondary header with configurable CUC time field\n      - PUS CRC-16 (CCITT, polynomial 0x1021)\n      - PUS Service 3 housekeeping (TM[3,25] / TM[3,26] SID-qualified) to Measurement<T> with UnitsNet units and quality assessment",
